00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.600
- [Narrator] When Phinyo
started as a firefighter

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.430
back in 1989, the majority of his job

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.360
was focused on fire rescue.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:38.623
However, in recent years,
his job has expanded.

00:00:38.623 --> 00:00:42.956
(Phinyo speaks in foreign language)

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.150
In recent years, new houses in Bangkok

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:50.240
have been built in areas
where snakes were more common,

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.670
which means snakes are
slithering their way

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:55.150
into houses on a more regular basis.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.733
(upbeat music)

